// Package decode holds the strict Buzz-to-Go decoders for the boundary types Buzz
// hands to magus, one Decode<T>(vm.Value) (T, error) per type cmd/magus-utils lists in
// inboundTypes, and the spell contract's signature table.
//
// Strict means every mismatch is an error naming the field path
// (`language.comments.blockComments[1].close: want str, got int`): a wrong kind, a member
// the type does not declare, an enum string outside its cases. An absent member keeps
// its zero value, a null optional stays nil, and an empty list or map decodes to nil, so
// Decode(Object(v)) == v holds for every value, zero included.
//
// It imports only vm, spells and types, so internal/spell can import it.
package decode

import (
	"fmt"

	vm "github.com/egladman/magus/libs/gopherbuzz/vm"
	"github.com/egladman/magus/spells"
)

